      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-06T11:34:47.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹13.12 (vs ₹3.00 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.12 (up from ₹3.00 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹34.8b (up 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.13b (up ₹2.60b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.1% (up from net loss in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 88% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 116% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
